   "text": "customData.kind = \"issue\"\n\nThe label is the observation.\nAn agent researches the repo,\ngh opens the issue, and the\nURL lands back on the block.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
