   "text": "POST /api/elements/sync\nMerge by id: the highest version\nwins, versionNonce breaks the tie.\nDeletion travels as a tombstone —\nabsence never means delete.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
